export async function renderFrame(ctx,t,w,h){if(t>=6.15)return renderFrozenHead(ctx,t+1.75,w,h);const s=state(t),b=await backgrounds(),bg=s.branch==='north_tv'?b.north:b.wide;return renderPaint(ctx,t,w,h,{size:[bg.width,bg.height],bg,layers:async()=>[{img:await layer(s,t,bg),x:0,y:0,sc:1}],light:()=>lighting(s,t),glow:()=>[],emit:(x)=>lampEmit(x,s,t),cam:()=>({x:bg.width/2,y:bg.height/2,fit:1})})}
